00:58:25.620 --> 00:58:31.400
<v Dan Collison>It was ludicrous and paranoid to think about foul play, but it did cross my mind.
<v Dan Collison>认为有人想加害我是荒谬和多疑的，但这确实在我脑海中闪过。

00:58:31.400 --> 00:58:55.100
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

00:58:55.100 --> 00:59:00.100
